Thanks to Brusche, Johan [johan.brusche@hp.com]

The answer was given by Vincent, Jean-marc [Jean-Marc.Vincent@hp.com] also
from HP (French support).

In Fact because of the installed version of sendmail, the system believes
that this patch is installed while it's not.

The solution is to the following commands :

# cd /var/adm/patch
# mkdir .enable
# cd .enable
# touch OSFPAT02700900540

And the upgrade is soon finished.

Regards

Daniel


